ニスは、前立腺と精嚢の摩擦で精液を漏らす。女性が少年を支える。少年のペニスに触れてはいけない。\n（バリエーション）\n-多くの異なるペニスが少年を蹂躙している。一番大きなペニスは容赦なく突き刺す。少年の小さなペニスは柔らかく、可哀想に振り回される。少年の精液はすべて排出された。無数の乾いた女のオーガズムで前立腺と身体が震える。\n女性はとても幸せです。少年は女性のセックスで本当に気持ち良いことを覚えました。", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1579, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "絶対絶命", "screen_name": "zettaizetumei", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1806059390946115584/JR8QbDVP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/169331256/1719433089/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 364017, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "でんたりす🔞", "screen_name": "denta_lis", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1059329179211128832/BnGDjsvu.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4556769440/1677485613/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 634823, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぷらす＋＋＋", "screen_name": "puni_101010", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1320052893307727872/wVttRqQW.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3197739840/1603560111/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, 